  ✓ Implement solution.py and generate solution.mpy
  ✓ Build executable K semantics and verification helpers
  ✓ Write contract claims in spec.k and prove with kprove
  ✓ Exercise with krun, finalize reproducible prove.sh, and verify all deliverables
